unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.\" credits=\"[object Object]\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"beeBlock__container\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--default\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">Let's create</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(-5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">a remarkable</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">journey</h2></div></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--reveal\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--1\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\">your gateway</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--2\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(-5%, 100%, 0px);\">to excitement</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--3\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\">starts here !</h2></div></div></div></div><!----></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__bottom\"><button data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__credits\" style=\"pointer-events: auto; cursor: pointer;\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"credits__button\" style=\"\">Credits</div></button><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__networks\"><a data-v-3d08a041=\"\" data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"mainButton networks__link yellow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/leo_parpeix\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"networks__link networks__link--email yellow\" data-cursor-indication-preserve=\"\"><span data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"networks__emailHit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> lparpeix@gmail.com</p><a data-v-3d08a041=\"\" data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"mainButton networks__link yellow\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/leo-parpeix\" target=\"_blank\">Linkedin</a></div><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__copyright\">© 2026</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__popup yellow\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__transitionWrapper--outer\" style=\"\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__transitionWrapper--inner\" style=\"\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__top\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__star\">*</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__infos\">about this Portfolio</p><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__cross yellow\" style=\"\"><svg data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"svg-cross cross__icon\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 11 11\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect y=\"5\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\" transform=\"rotate(-90 5 11)\"></rect></svg></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__content\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__left\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"left__content\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">A huge shout-out to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://twitter.com/LecornuThoma\">Thoma Lecornu</a>,</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">who jumped onto this project with me.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">His personality and determination</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">were, for sure, one of the key elements</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">in the success of this portfolio.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">And, a big shout-out to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vic.rou\">Victor</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/felix-sikora/\">Félix</a></p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lucas_gssr/\">Lucas</a> for their patience and 3D</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">crazy skills !</p></div></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__right\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__textBlock\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__text\">My goal was to strike the right balance between an immersive 3D experience and a clean 2D environment, allowing visitors to explore my projects in a single scroll and understand my skill set in under 10 seconds.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__textBlock\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__text\">I built the concept around the moustache daisy, a symbol that reflects both my personality and my creative approach. As the experience unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__overlay\" style=\"opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;\"></div></div></div></div></main>",
  "text": "Léo Parpeix\nArt director, Interactive designer\n\nWorld building\n\nLéo Parpeix\nArt director, Interactive designer\nWork\nAbout\nPlayground\nDISCOVER MORE\n\nI enjoy trying out fresh techniques and playing with unique layer compositions, often inspired by my creative observations or simply from wandering around.\n\nWELCOME ON\nMY DESIGN\nPLAYGROUND\nALWAYS\nPUSHING\nFURTHER\n(Click to feed the bee)\n\nInteractive hero concept\n\n2025\n\nPortfolio loader animation\n\n2025\n\nJitter animation\n\n2024\n\n3D Exploration\n\n2024\n\nPage transition concept\n\n2024\n\nPoster exploration\n\n2023\n\n3D Exploration\n\n2024\n\nI enjoy trying out fresh techniques and playing with unique layer compositions, often inspired by my creative observations or simply from wandering around.\n\n3D webgl ring\n\n2024\n\nPersonal branding - 3D Exploration\n\n2023\n\nPrint layout #1\n\n2023\n\nPortfolio explorations\n\n2024\n\nPrint layout #2\n\n2023\n\nMenu research\n\n2023\n\nMotion poster\n\n2025\n\nBranding research\n\n2022\n\nLET'S CREATE\nA REMARKABLE\nJOURNEY\nYOUR GATEWAY\nTO EXCITEMENT\nSTARTS HERE !\nCredits\nInstagram\n\nlparpeix@gmail.com\n\nLinkedin\n\n© 2026\n\n*\n\nABOUT THIS PORTFOLIO\n\nA huge shout-out to Thoma Lecornu,\n\nwho jumped onto this project with me.\n\nHis personality and determination\n\nwere, for sure, one of the key elements\n\nin the success of this portfolio.\n\nAnd, a big shout-out to Victor, Félix\n\nand Lucas for their patience and 3D\n\ncrazy skills !\n\nMy goal was to strike the right balance between an immersive 3D experience and a clean 2D environment, allowing visitors to explore my projects in a single scroll and understand my skill set in under 10 seconds.\n\nI built the concept around the moustache daisy, a symbol that reflects both my personality and my creative approach. As the experience unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.",
  "url": "https://www.leoparpeix.com/playground"
}